<section class="load-estimator" id="load-estimator" data-load-estimator aria-labelledby="load-estimator-heading">
 <div class="wrap load-layout">
  <div><span class="load-kicker">Junk removal · visualize your load</span><h2 id="load-estimator-heading">How much truck space do you need?</h2><p>Move the slider to see how your items could fit inside a box truck. This is a visual planning guide, not a measurement of your items or a confirmed quote.</p><p>Need the garage cleaned and organized too? <a class="load-service-link" href="/garage-cleaning-fort-collins-co">Explore garage cleaning</a>. Cleaning and organization are quoted for the work your space needs, separately from this load guide.</p></div>
  <div class="load-card">
   <svg class="load-truck" viewBox="0 0 500 220" role="img" aria-label="Illustrated box truck with an animated cargo fill"><defs><clipPath id="load-cargo-clip"><rect x="30" y="26" width="315" height="135" rx="5"/></clipPath></defs><rect x="20" y="16" width="335" height="155" rx="10" fill="#e9f0f4" stroke="#183a50" stroke-width="5"/><svg x="30" y="26" width="315" height="135" viewBox="0 0 315 135"><rect class="load-fill" width="157.5" height="135" fill="#ed7943"/><path d="M79 0v135M158 0v135M237 0v135" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".7" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 6"/></svg><path d="M355 64h65l49 56v51H355Z" fill="#fff" stroke="#183a50" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M370 77h42l30 37h-72Z" fill="#afd5e3"/><path d="M17 175h459" stroke="#183a50" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="93" cy="179" r="26" fill="#183a50"/><circle cx="93" cy="179" r="12" fill="#afc5d1"/><circle cx="414" cy="179" r="26" fill="#183a50"/><circle cx="414" cy="179" r="12" fill="#afc5d1"/></svg>
   <div data-load-controls hidden><label for="junk-load-size">Choose your estimated load size</label><output for="junk-load-size" data-load-label>½ truck · 50%</output><input id="junk-load-size" data-load-slider type="range" min="1" max="8" step="1" value="4" aria-describedby="load-pricing-note"><div class="load-presets" aria-label="Load size shortcuts"><button type="button" data-load-step="1">⅛ truck</button><button type="button" data-load-step="2">¼ truck</button><button type="button" data-load-step="4">½ truck</button><button type="button" data-load-step="8">Full truck</button></div></div>
   <div class="load-price" data-load-price aria-live="polite">Get an on-site quote</div><p id="load-pricing-note" data-load-detail>Online volume pricing is not available yet. Book a free walkthrough for your exact price.</p><noscript><p>The interactive load guide needs JavaScript. You can still request a free walkthrough below.</p></noscript><a class="load-cta" href="/book">Get my free walkthrough →</a>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
